  "description": {
    "raw": "You create a warhammer of magically hardened\nice and send it hurling toward the target.\nYou must succeed at a ranged touch attack\nto strike the target. If hit, the target takes 1d8\npoints of damage per 2 caster levels you possess\n(maximum 5d8); half this damage is bludgeoning\ndamage, half is cold damage. The frosthammer\ncounts as having a +1 enhancement bonus for the\npurpose of bypassing DR. If the target takes any\nbludgeoning damage from the hammer, you may attempt a\ntrip combat maneuver check against that target, except you may\nuse your caster level instead of your BAB and your spellcasting\nability modifier (Wisdom for clerics, and so on) instead of your\nStrength modifier.",
    "search_text": "\"you create a warhammer of magically hardened\\nice and send it hurling toward the target.\\nyou must succeed at a ranged touch attack\\nto strike the target. if hit, the target takes 1d8\\npoints of damage per 2 caster levels you possess\\n(maximum 5d8); half this damage is bludgeoning\\ndamage, half is cold damage. the frosthammer\\ncounts as having a +1 enhancement bonus for the\\npurpose of bypassing dr. if the target takes any\\nbludgeoning damage from the hammer, you may attempt a\\ntrip combat maneuver check against that target, except you may\\nuse your caster level instead of your bab and your spellcasting\\nability modifier (wisdom for clerics, and so on) instead of your\\nstrength modifier.\"",
    "sections": [],
    "document": {
      "node_type": "document",
      "content": [
